#: ../../site-reference/index.md:1 2952356a2f744080a9bd46c5dcb62df5
msgid "Site reference"
msgstr "站点参考"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:3 e639470df54a40698ed3d0edc8de73df
msgid ""
"What the platform actually consists of, area by area — and, in the "
"generated inventories, every single route it serves."
msgstr "平台各区域的实际构成——以及在自动生成的清单中列出的每一条它所提供的路由。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:5 8a859cebd8bd4646b8c26f7cf7a8e1b5
msgid ""
"RMH Studios is one web platform with an unusually wide surface: a social "
"feed, ~18 browser games (several real-time multiplayer or 3D), a dozen "
"full applications, a blog/news/library stack, a coin economy with Stripe "
"memberships, and a scoped public API. That breadth is exactly why an "
"inventory matters — it is otherwise very easy for a page to exist that "
"nothing documents."
msgstr ""
"RMH Studios 是一个覆盖面异常广泛的单一 Web 平台：一个社交动态流、约 18 款浏览器游戏（其中多款为实时多人或 3D "
"游戏）、十几个完整应用、博客/新闻/资料库体系、基于 Stripe 会员的金币经济系统，以及一个作用域受限的公开 "
"API。正因为覆盖面如此之广，清单才显得格外重要——否则很容易出现某个页面存在却无人记录的情况。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:7 b6a3d601e0434999b0634efe9690f2e4
msgid "How this section is organised"
msgstr "本节的组织方式"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:9 f42dfa345ff74dfda1c6e3cb9fb12504
msgid ""
"The **area guides** are hand-written. They explain what an area is for, "
"which routes belong to it, and which modules implement it — the kind of "
"thing that only makes sense written by a person."
msgstr "**区域指南**是手写的。它们说明某个区域的用途、归属于它的路由，以及实现它的模块——这类内容只有由人来撰写才有意义。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:11 6c76fa864eea49f29c0fb2c57a98a564
msgid ""
"The **inventories** are generated by `pnpm docs:site`, straight from "
"`app/routes/` and the product catalogs. They are exhaustive by "
"construction: if a route exists, it is listed. `pnpm docs:site --check` "
"fails when they drift, so they cannot quietly go stale."
msgstr ""
"**清单**由 `pnpm docs:site` 直接从 `app/routes/` "
"和产品目录生成。它们在结构上就是详尽无遗的：只要路由存在，就会被列出。一旦出现偏差，`pnpm docs:site --check` "
"就会失败，因此它们不会悄悄过时。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:17 fecc5f76f1cb43b4997c8854d7b5331e
msgid "Social"
msgstr "社交"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:21 6037085ce16c41c783f3600b5d627ed3
msgid "The RMHarks feed, profiles, messaging, communities, groups and presence."
msgstr "RMHarks 动态流、个人主页、消息、社区、群组与在线状态。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:24 14caed7702d24d938326770e364edf15
msgid "Economy & progression"
msgstr "经济与成长"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:28 46153619df394a26b4214e9f1152599f
msgid ""
"Coins, the shop and market, staking, quests, XP, battle pass, memberships"
" and competitive play."
msgstr "金币、商店与市场、质押、任务、经验值、战斗通行证、会员与竞技玩法。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:31 add7c599251c44e5958f47dcfefba29d
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:35 c61353d4ad5344769c2bc97d26437ad0
msgid "Blog, news, the document library, builds, and the creator surfaces."
msgstr "博客、新闻、资料库、创作成果（builds）以及创作者相关页面。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:38 e1d9cc5093bc43f1a709a5af60c02859
msgid "Games & apps"
msgstr "游戏与应用"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:42 65247575eba1438eb22af70bc22d355d
msgid ""
"How a game or app is wired into the site, plus leaderboards, saves and "
"replays."
msgstr "游戏或应用如何接入站点，以及排行榜、存档与回放。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:45 f0b7018e40ae4b3d8564d079ec09a17a
msgid "Page routes"
msgstr "页面路由"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:49 3400e96d5bc040c58f382d466bbb444d
msgid ""
"**Generated.** Every page URL, its title, its access level and its source"
" file."
msgstr "**自动生成。** 每个页面的 URL、标题、访问级别及其源文件。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:52 086e18521c5f4ec6880caa39b1326728
msgid "API routes"
msgstr "API 路由"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:56 b39689a33d184668ac8ede60c3743c84
msgid ""
"**Generated.** Every server route in the app tier, with the HTTP methods "
"it handles."
msgstr "**自动生成。** 应用层中的每一个服务器路由，以及它所处理的 HTTP 方法。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:59 c38ec66475a546598a18479725cc7b0e
msgid "Game catalog"
msgstr "游戏目录"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:63 146eff2c55934117868a1bb18a819b48
msgid ""
"**Generated** from `lib/games.ts` — every game, including the unlisted "
"ones."
msgstr "**自动生成**自 `lib/games.ts`——包含全部游戏，含未公开列出的游戏。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:66 faadb7edc7e94663a23f391cbe79d120
msgid "App catalog"
msgstr "应用目录"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:70 5ce6b4beda0a46379245eba05aff2b7e
msgid "**Generated** from `lib/apps.ts` — every application."
msgstr "**自动生成**自 `lib/apps.ts`——包含全部应用。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:74 a2b62a4523c441398b2bcfe524a3c08d
msgid "Two shells, and why it matters"
msgstr "两种外壳，及其重要性"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:76 c40b783c675e418bae778c7e47cfe8c4
msgid ""
"Where a route file lives decides how the page is framed, and this trips "
"people up more than anything else in the routing layer:"
msgstr "路由文件所在的位置决定了页面的呈现框架，这是路由层中最容易让人栽跟头的地方："

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:78 5f5ab0e1c4844b208b4c72c535031d4c
msgid ""
"Files under `app/routes/_site/` render inside the **site shell** — the "
"radial nav hub, sidebar, context rail, skip link and `<main>` landmark."
msgstr ""
"`app/routes/_site/` 下的文件渲染在**站点外壳**中——包括放射式导航中枢、侧边栏、上下文栏、跳转链接以及 `<main>` "
"地标区域。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:79 d7aff5b1c1ff44009f4349b8d1a04f38
msgid "Top-level files render **full-screen**, with no shell at all."
msgstr "顶层文件以**全屏**方式渲染，完全没有外壳。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:81 9f114c76a5c74be285ac1d900a0b0684
msgid ""
"Games, `/login`, the `secret/*` games, `discord/*` and the legal pages "
"are top-level *on purpose*. Moving one under `_site/` to \"make it "
"consistent\" would wrap a full-screen game in a sidebar. The full-screen "
"apps have their own chrome tier in `components/shared/` (`AppShell`, "
"`AppHeader`, the `--app-*` token contract)."
msgstr ""
"游戏、`/login`、`secret/*` 游戏、`discord/*` "
"以及法律页面之所以是顶层路由，*是刻意为之*。若为了\"保持一致\"而将其中某个移到 `_site/` "
"下，就会让一个全屏游戏被包进侧边栏。全屏应用在 "
"`components/shared/`（`AppShell`、`AppHeader`、`--app-*` 令牌契约）中拥有自己独立的外壳层。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:83 71a7694925034a3f8f8f9e66ce569647
msgid ""
"The generated [page inventory](./pages.md) splits its tables along "
"exactly this line, so you can see which pages are in which world."
msgstr "自动生成的[页面清单](./pages.md)正是按这条界线拆分表格的，因此你可以清楚地看到哪些页面属于哪个世界。"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:85 36235fa7bce142db867cab43b5a09962
msgid "The trust rule"
msgstr "信任规则"

#: ../../site-reference/index.md:87 bbc1e81c6d4d451b8c3eb5ed876ad3df
msgid ""
"These pages describe the site as it is at the commit they were generated "
"from. Where a hand-written guide and the code disagree, the code wins — "
"and the guide is a bug. Report it or fix it; don't work around it."
msgstr ""
"这些页面描述的是生成它们所依据的那个提交时的站点状态。当手写指南与代码不一致时，以代码为准——此时指南本身就是一个 "
"bug。请报告它或修复它，而不要绕过它。"

